#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:5
#: 749020ed78834fd48205e7d17085e057 798a6870470243bb9c3d9b825ad52500
#: 7d4c85ae344440d1a929395a1a8e4520 8bc481c7c0ee44d094cdbb9258f218df
#: ed03f1aa9e6b4efca7135c39613acf5a
msgid "Electro Permanent Magnet Gripper (EPM688)"
msgstr "电永磁抓手（EPM688）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:7
#: 41b86342e5364eadb9775817fc0aa01d 6b4042a6aea748f2a35eed41cef1129f
#: 90736f8fe44240369c058d3b789794fb d251f236e994403eb529e56f42aea14d
#: f2d0f1f8d9664d6fbd0c8d50a69c7c0a
msgid ""
"This article shows how to use the `Electro Permanent Magnet Gripper (EPM688)"
" <http://nicadrone.com/index.php?id_product=13&controller=product>`__ with "
"ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何在 ArduPilot 中使用 `电永磁抓手（EPM688） "
"<http://nicadrone.com/index.php?id_product=13&controller=product>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:11
#: 22a52c4f03854087802bc1aa878ba274 2e9e371a2e1e42fc8e8018cb5b91cf9c
#: 41516007f73a4415b2229a45785e0238 6ac145997fa24bbf9cacb8bdca51004c
#: 96ca4dcdb37249ff98f17ed9cfb691d6
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:13
#: 119f72b341b544379218cfd02d17f668 1677c6c1743b4bbeb621b3b2e69fc0a0
#: 4aa65ba2e2754ae4902c51626adf317f 697997166cb14e4cb3cdd006bdaece97
#: 78bb8e4523b641b89f3759ff0cc4675e
msgid ""
"The *EPM688* (from NicaDrone.com) is a small (less than 4cm x 4cm x 2cm) "
"Electro Permanent Magnet gripper capable of 7kg of force meaning it can hold"
" about 1kg of cargo.  The gripping and releasing of the cargo if "
"accomplished by delivering a short pulse to an electromagnet which reverses "
"its field.  Objects that it grips onto should be metal or have the included "
"`thin steel target square "
"<http://nicadrone.com/index.php?id_product=15&controller=product>`__ "
"attached to them."
msgstr ""
"*EPM688*（来自 NicaDrone.com）是一款小型（小于 4cm x 4cm x 2cm）电永磁抓手，可产生 7kg 的吸附力，能抓持约 "
"1kg 的货物。货物的抓取与释放通过向电磁铁施加短脉冲来实现，短脉冲会使磁场反向。所吸附的物体应为金属材质，或附有随附的 `薄钢靶方块 "
"<http://nicadrone.com/index.php?id_product=15&controller=product>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:21
#: 2d900cc5057941088899e38b9add072e 45b0017c07ae4d9abd5a8bcf86782a71
#: 8e18017ca1f24eebb80be001d74a17a7 96d1853501df43189d3cc7543ecfbbc4
#: bf118e439a514681b73b77ea3860902a
msgid ""
"The device accepts a standard PWM servo input and uses a 5V power supply.  "
"Significant amounts of power are only required for less than 1 second when "
"it first grips or releases the cargo."
msgstr "该设备接受标准 PWM 舵机输入，使用 5V 电源。只有在首次抓取或释放货物时不到 1 秒内才需要较大电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:25
#: 0dba451636e445e3b7f85f27f460f2bd 36299e6cfdb3453d833a0bea79ba7535
#: 5995d5075b354f468669db85f97bc7e4 686e193180d54a789813f95c2920135d
#: a24e3e11e993452db9fe3c0ed8f5bd4f
msgid ""
"`See Kickstarter **Video** of the product here "
"<https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/412473553/opengrab-open-hardware-"
"electro-permanent-cargo-gri/widget/video.html>`__!"
msgstr ""
"`在此查看产品的 Kickstarter **视频** "
"<https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/412473553/opengrab-open-hardware-"
"electro-permanent-cargo-gri/widget/video.html>`__！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:28
#: 58e84f65160549f2827c180c7df3f451 a6ee1c9a36a8426f83fbe40dcb96836c
#: cb37af9138bd467d89d7262a13890c72 e233f2179a434369807ba1bafe45b0a5
#: fc5cc12688d64f5b95e48b86bd73d81e
msgid "Connecting to a Pixhawk"
msgstr "连接到 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:33
#: 105d0da35ced4f1490911213a00af266 480c654935d44de598613650cee23626
#: 5e941be6573542758a6ce951ae3ef5b7 838b07b7f64a47f18a7d56c12b8a053e
#: 869be6af891a4d64b5fa062865ed371d
msgid ""
"The EPM is connected to the Pixhawk in the same way as a :ref:`servo "
"<common-servo>`."
msgstr "EPM 以与 :ref:`舵机 <common-servo>` 相同的方式连接到 Pixhawk。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:36
#: 4808d3a34f9043559a2b9f1638e0d925 4db98de0f59145b39ec7ee4ec11baf92
#: a4e4cff712fa4d8cb7f6559c0cb55429 acff129e89f4462da5a4f390f6899c64
#: e53aa3571ae447ee998bf58f51ca78c1
msgid ""
"If using Copter, Connect the EPM to AUX OUT 1, 2, 3 or 4.  MAIN OUT 1 ~ 8 "
"cannot be used because the EPM does not accept the 400hz update rate.  AUX "
"OUT 5 an 6 cannot be used because they are reserved for :ref:`Relays "
"<common-relay>`."
msgstr ""
"如果使用多旋翼飞行器，将 EPM 连接到 AUX OUT 1、2、3 或 4。MAIN OUT 1~8 不能使用，因为 EPM 不接受 400Hz "
"的更新频率。AUX OUT 5 和 6 不能使用，因为它们保留给 :ref:`继电器 <common-relay>` 使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:40
#: 1293638243ec4ae3b903ac0b09c8e9fa 694cf59a4dc749ccb162689b7787bf93
#: 92e9a4a41faf4b0ea88f4e489d39e2f6 b84d01eb08584ba080e3021590e7eed4
#: d1799b7302674878b26d640c829bc09b
msgid ""
"If using Plane or Rover where all pwm pins update at 50hz, any unused MAIN "
"OUT or AUX OUT 1 ~ 4 may be used."
msgstr "如果使用固定翼或 Rover（所有 PWM 引脚以 50Hz 更新），可以使用任意未使用的 MAIN OUT 或 AUX OUT 1~4。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:42
#: 13a358d58abb46f3ac3e1d307d302d4d 1c9cfa101dfb4ee9b7519324d0333019
#: 28aba15b37934fceba8fcc30a574c856 369cc0c9150c4e1e8a00ef690a60d200
#: f5369740d3bf4336b4e0636cb4836a71
msgid ""
"A BEC or ESC should be used that can provide 600milliamps of current at 5V "
"for the short period that the gripper is first activated to latch onto the "
"cargo."
msgstr "应使用能在短时间内提供 5V 600mA 电流的 BEC 或电调，以在抓手首次激活锁定货物时供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:47
#: 0cddf6af6bc74117ad72c401f02be9fd 7ead38d39e89440d9d459e4c1d5dcfc8
#: 841f1a11b62144e1b6c73c99f1e26d16 84eacec6c67240e3bc0db600c3e6dbb1
#: 907ec8b88de1492cacb4ddbd649fd6c8
msgid "Controlling from a transmitter using servo pass-through"
msgstr "通过舵机直通从遥控器控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:49
#: 5c2e5c4137ac42169708001b2bf7026f 7550f13d214346eeb2bc4b2c374555a1
#: aa8c159325544e5283a8897f705cd6f6 e19bc3db13a64f12b3f1db39ed30373a
#: fe8622504b1d46f0a1ab7aea2e96fc74
msgid ""
"Unfortunately with the latest versions of Copter, Plane and Rover the EPM "
"can be controlled either from the transmitter OR during missions. Either is "
"possible but parameter changes are required meaning both methods are not "
"available during a single flight.  Below are instructions for setting up "
"manual control through a transmitter."
msgstr ""
"遗憾的是，在最新版本的 Copter、Plane 和 Rover 中，EPM 只能通过遥控器 **或** "
"在任务中控制，二者不能在同一次飞行中同时使用。以下是通过遥控器设置手动控制的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:58
#: 0dfa9ef1c2964935857f2d18cb2b43b4 1d3b0d152bd34e85b249e5bfb601ae3b
#: 90e8963cbffc4edca04e2438ea377d45 c9e7aec25ba2434cae96098937232d1c
#: db24577f1629494f85a08624a2c7ca2b
msgid ""
"Control using the transmitter is accomplished by setting up \"RC Pass "
"Through\" which means the \"input\" channel from the transmitter is passed "
"through to the autopilot's \"output\" channel of the same number.  For "
"Copter this means you must have a transmitter capable of 9 or more channels "
"because the EPM is connected to output ch9 (or higher)."
msgstr ""
"通过遥控器控制是通过设置「RC 直通」来实现的，即遥控器的「输入」通道直通到飞控的同编号「输出」通道。对于多旋翼飞行器，这意味着您需要一台能发送 9 "
"个或更多通道的遥控器，因为 EPM 连接到输出通道 9（或更高）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:64
#: 2b00fd1fb153454cb635ee0cc3342c3e 5eaee75869514c26a71255202741a449
#: afb50981a3fd4219b0cb72983ba46722 e482f71022354e33bfbc7de37330414f
#: fb9fe28806664a9aad926cc73c4c2eef
msgid ""
"Assuming the above is possible for your set-up, connect with the mission "
"planner.  Go to the Config/Tuning >> Full Parameters List and set the "
":ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION<SERVO9_FUNCTION>` (or RC9_FUNCTION) to \"1\" (i.e. "
"\"RCPassThru\").  Note that if the EPM is connected to AUX OUT 2 then "
":ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION<SERVO10_FUNCTION>` should be set instead, etc."
msgstr ""
"如果您的设置满足上述条件，请连接 Mission Planner。进入配置/调参 >> 完整参数列表，将 "
":ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION<SERVO9_FUNCTION>` （或 "
"RC9_FUNCTION）设置为「1」（即「RCPassThru」）。请注意，如果 EPM 连接到 AUX OUT 2，则应改为设置 "
":ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION<SERVO10_FUNCTION>`，以此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:69
#: 3391dbc9b00242ffba4f3c1d900e71bf 453cf89873d840a486604ba6be81cc30
#: 5ed57b8e7eac416b9cd07773cb9256e7 60e2dcb385f6431a89509b59317f43ad
#: 67a24a8a4b1f47e492429317957a891e
msgid ""
"On the transmitter set CH9 to be controlled from a 3-position switch and the"
" positions set as follows:"
msgstr "在遥控器上将第 9 通道设置为由三段开关控制，位置设置如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:72
#: 220fbe7f17b94b7cbbea1a40093dd54b 9b5763c99bdd470593d74a411ec64f1f
#: dab9f3014ec6453eb449c96ad98ef3e0 e85829b62d564ae290be34d99204b072
#: f84abcbd4af84bb4bb6d8bf97e474bc9
msgid "*low position set to about **1100 pwm**.  This will release the cargo*"
msgstr "*低位设置约为 **1100 pwm**，将释放货物*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:74
#: 288944957f6d4722863537406e08af12 6691cbdff6b34f948327984816ca3407
#: 75ee6e6e386544658c388a6e0d6d52f7 c0bc39616d384431b79efda61a315f99
#: f10f54dd982c46ecb338d4b307fa5191
msgid ""
"*mid position set to about **1500 pwm**.  This is the neutral position, "
"after pulling the switch high or low to grab or release, the switch should "
"be returned to this position*"
msgstr "*中位设置约为 **1500 pwm**，这是中立位置，将开关拨至高位或低位抓取或释放货物后，应将开关恢复到此位置*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:77
#: 42899dc7b1954720b4bdda0eced84828 4bba484ffecb4dfe9616b623477df523
#: 86b5e0413796456c8172ece51037a5b3 8ce772801aeb442ca1bc175d918c4329
#: c9f8cedd5608482eb3db4840309a3a28
msgid ""
"*high position set to about **1900 pwm**.  This will activate the EPM so it "
"grips onto the cargo.*"
msgstr "*高位设置约为 **1900 pwm**，将激活 EPM 使其抓取货物。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:80
#: 0a2d672eda6f4df9bc4175d1e771bd2e 185224113e144972b194338017159657
#: 92165e0d91164f5fa86c05af8e96922d aa9e675b5e7d446793fb33667c0812e3
#: f9e57b75021f4e98a2e4ced50b6a2391
msgid ""
"To grab onto the cargo, bring the cargo close to the EPM and momentarily "
"bring the switch high and then return the switch to neutral."
msgstr "要抓取货物，将货物靠近 EPM，momentarily 将开关拨至高位，然后恢复到中立位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:83
#: 025793f3737e4a69a544191220873652 0b02cca086664c23ad9d9b97795a2c92
#: 8a82c9bdc62d467ba8c1be7f438e545c a33bf38a6db5470eb087f1cd3de47e44
#: eee616f014784419918fc0eb6f7b72be
msgid ""
"To release the cargo, momentarily bring the switch low and then return it to"
" neutral."
msgstr "要释放货物，momentarily 将开关拨至低位，然后恢复到中立位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:86
#: 1644beb6064742fc95c1eadecfe7f7d1 42593e2d332f4873a5e84252f35cf9dd
#: 7c26fccb4c7a45628845314d3ecf6946 85030d48c9274ec7b360eef255de41de
#: 9ad7952a95a04ead8ddb113c57970422
msgid ""
"Note: the :ref:`Copter Ch7/Ch8 switch <copter:channel-7-and-8-options>` "
"includes options for the EPM but these unfortunately do not function "
"properly."
msgstr ""
"注意：:ref:`Copter 通道 7/8 开关 <copter:channel-7-and-8-options>` 中包含 EPM "
"选项，但遗憾的是这些选项无法正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:90
#: 1c86377a3e20438cbd0dc79767ab5185 21dd48aac27648fc9d03cb53b16a95bc
#: 89a3836319cb47ee93da9d70027a3e38 8af6c6a90c25449b8bdb362f1bf6fba5
#: f38fc73c7b0f48f3bb5293c83e9cfedb
msgid ""
"Note: it is also possible (if using an older style, non ppm-sum receiver) to"
" directly connect one signal wire from the receiver to the EPM's PWM pin "
"thus bypassing the autopilot completely.  The image below shows the power "
"line between the receiver and EPM connected but this is not correct and is "
"quite dangerous because power spikes could pass through the receiver to the "
"autopilot.  Only PWM and Ground should be connected.  The EPM should be "
"powered from a BEC (not shown below)."
msgstr ""
"注意：如果使用旧式非 PPM 综合接收机，也可以直接将接收机的一根信号线连接到 EPM 的 PWM 引脚，从而完全绕过飞控。下方图片显示了接收机与 "
"EPM 之间连接了电源线，但这是不正确的，非常危险，因为电源尖峰可能通过接收机传导到飞控。只应连接 PWM 和地线。EPM 应由 BEC "
"供电（下图未显示）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:104
#: 12e083a101764077b257f5a24a5e3816 6d574504e99d46dc8a663719944a2c32
#: 73ea25d3bae94fb0919d545f0546977b ca1f2e61b0c74768b5277d80af05ea78
#: def6ab5e8370496b8fa1aa5d16130cca
msgid "Controlling during missions and from GCS"
msgstr "在任务中及从地面站控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:106
#: 0a2b2cad3427460faa333db925e0f218 44f8cc0520ae43eda550519e998432f8
#: 5987303f963e42619d1890703229a09a 7aa4b4f7a223438ab22cbcd9496c0f99
#: fe050c2ae03e4b318c50cf59277b817f
msgid ""
"As mentioned above, the EPM can be controlled either through a transmitter "
"or from the ground station (including during missions, aka \\ :ref:`AUTO "
"mode <copter:auto-mode>`) but not both during the same flight. Below are "
"instructions for setting up control through the ground station."
msgstr ""
"如上所述，EPM 只能通过遥控器 **或** 地面站（包括任务中，即 :ref:`Auto 模式 <copter:auto-"
"mode>`）进行控制，不能在同一次飞行中同时使用两者。以下是通过地面站设置控制的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:115
#: 7d5ac601b8f14548b80628514e879edb 88f8a06853ce4b8497963ffba609876c
#: b8e90a74e20a4f588538ac32632e9914 ca3a250a4b2841918b7d2377ea4b9ca2
#: e2b6e1cc2ca04872b5443fcd8dc68e78
msgid ""
"Connect with the mission planner. Go to the Config/Tuning >> Full Parameters"
" List and set the :ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION<SERVO9_FUNCTION>` (or RC9_FUNCTION) "
"to \"0\" (its default value). Note that if the EPM is connected to Pixhawk's"
" AUX OUT 2 then :ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION<SERVO10_FUNCTION>` (or RC10_FUNCTION)"
" should be set instead, etc."
msgstr ""
"连接 Mission Planner。进入配置/调参 >> 完整参数列表，将 "
":ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION<SERVO9_FUNCTION>` （或 RC9_FUNCTION）设置为「0」（默认值）。请注意，如果 "
"EPM 连接到 Pixhawk 的 AUX OUT 2，则应改为设置 :ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION<SERVO10_FUNCTION>`"
" （或 RC10_FUNCTION），以此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:120
#: 1e5e2ac63cc2498c98b63987ca8dd26d 31a122e255334baea7e09b85e3a588bb
#: 99503f6e6be24b73a8bc86073e6fa440 bfa6ca0bb5d94404a66a11f512987966
#: ec93fba55955449994e93a416c28d2de
msgid ""
"Create the mission you wish to fly and add pairs of ``DO_GRIPPER`` commands "
"to grip or release the cargo .The EPM is returned to neutral after each "
"command."
msgstr "创建您要飞行的任务，并添加成对的 ``DO_GRIPPER`` 指令以抓取或释放货物。每条指令执行后，EPM 恢复到中立位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:123
#: 11b9c93fed544589b05b3994f84fdad6 554c296d458c4c968f9274bbcc7b6429
#: 62a5cb2cfb6a44c5b98092547197c329 6936ff7f3ceb4e359df5557040aec4b7
#: 956d9d716c8f46279ef28d074937cbaa
msgid ""
"\"Ser No\" should be set according to which output the EPM is connected to "
"(i.e. \"9\" = Pixhawk's AUX OUT 1, \"10\" = APM2's RC10)."
msgstr ""
"「Ser No」应根据 EPM 所连接的输出编号设置（即「9」= Pixhawk 的 AUX OUT 1，「10」= APM2 的 RC10）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:125
#: 32d4c12f0aba448d966dba738a4fc5bf 4499ce682a7e4fb2b89874304603fd5f
#: 54a11874163a41e792bb3d11cc8cc186 7b252d282b9946c1b9d2aa1c96c1821f
#: cb9405ef797f41318e97cda14a294064
msgid ""
"\"PWM\" should be set to **1100ms** to release the cargo, **1500ms** to "
"return to neutral, and \\ **1900ms** to grip the cargo."
msgstr "「PWM」应设置为 **1100ms** 以释放货物，**1500ms** 以恢复中立，**1900ms** 以抓取货物。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:131
#: 4de5c532206b40c29032e9a1c904eef7 7737d389d16545379687efd8b69c861f
#: 8d574b4ca2b3410eba70cd010936f3da a76d5b592f244ef6b6470f9b587c0bc4
#: f0cedb985c8f47e58adeddc50371d54d
msgid ""
"In the example above the vehicle takes off to 20ft, flies west 548ft where "
"it delays for 5 seconds, releases the cargo, delays another 5 seconds and "
"then returns home."
msgstr "在上面的示例中，飞行器起飞至 20 英尺，向西飞行 548 英尺后延迟 5 秒，释放货物，再延迟 5 秒，然后返航。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:135
#: 10290263c31b4d82a01f61d175b15f72 3101e24ec2e74e18ab89384a5fd13137
#: 40733c83316c489fba7df584edcca983 42b59793f3ae4fe3a42476a0b65be9fe
#: 44cca33ae52946fb872dffc7ef530a8e
msgid ""
"In order to pick up the cargo before the mission begins, push the round "
"black button on the EPM to momentarily turn it on.  A cumbersome alternative"
" is to use the Mission Planner’s Flight Data screen's Servo tab to "
"momentarily set the output to 1900 pwm (i.e. \"High\" in the image below) "
"and then back to neutral (i.e. 1500 or \"Low\" in the image below)."
msgstr ""
"在任务开始前若要抓取货物，按下 EPM 上的黑色圆形按钮以momentarily 开启它。另一种繁琐的方法是使用 Mission Planner "
"飞行数据页面的舵机选项卡，momentarily 将输出设为 1900 pwm（即下图中的「High」），然后恢复到中立（即 1500 "
"或下图中的「Low」）。"

