#: 56204338c02c4e8f8393b5dc56152f98 5c53bc14a46d439b8cf35221636691ac
#: 7304474c17234e2985f1717d62b65c77
msgid ""
"The EPM has an onboard PIC12F MCU with an in circuit programming header to "
"allow easy reflashing."
msgstr "EPM 板载 PIC12F MCU，配有电路内编程接头，便于刷写固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:154
#: 1771f5bcb74d45fbaed050ec32dc5f43 29a5832cbf9e42afaf9fe9a28bff2a28
#: 45a0e11bcc2c402cb728a54ceaecb291 7ce0a7fe1ca64d6bbb1714ea8fc792a6
#: ec32c77eaa5949d0b1ffd75742e01748
msgid ""
"When first gripping or releasing the cargo it consumes 400mA for 0.4 "
"seconds.  The majority of the energy is consumed to move the target into "
"place and the rest realigns the magnets.  The on-board LED will blink "
"rapidly 4 times when a switching cycle is being executed"
msgstr ""
"首次抓取或释放货物时，消耗 400mA 电流约 0.4 秒。大部分能量用于将目标移到位，其余用于重新排列磁铁。执行切换周期时，板载 LED 将快速闪烁 "
"4 次"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:159
